\\ A durable effect left unhandled at main is a residual effect: the host discharges
\\ it (spec/tc1/DURABLE.md). run has no host, so it shows the first request, which
\\ the argument's emit precedes, and stops there.
\\
\\ Expected:
\\ > emit "argument": 41
\\ > host request 0: Store.put 41
\\ > outcome: none (waiting for the host's reply; run has no host)

(effect Store durable
  (put I64 --> I64))

(define main {I64 --> I64}
  input -> (+ (perform Store put (do (emit "argument" 41) 41)) 1))
